 county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, January to February hit 46% and August to September 54% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 167% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25075 has a preliminary estimate of 213.0 for August to September 2026, an estimate from NOAA rain that can differ from the final index.</p>"}
